msgstr ""

#: includes/class-simpletaxonomyrefreshed-admin-conversion.php:434
msgid "This is actually the Terms Import tool pre-filled with all the terms of the source taxonomy."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-simpletaxonomyrefreshed-admin-conversion.php:435
msgid "Once you have all the terms of the souurce taxonomy available in your browser you can edit this data into the set of terms to be imported."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-simpletaxonomyrefreshed-admin-conversion.php:436
msgid "As it is a set of text lines, you can also copy/paste them into an editor for local manipulation before the actual import process is carried out."
msgstr ""

